date-released: "2026-03-13"
version: "2026.03.13"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.18945510"
abstract: >-
  A comprehensive thyroid cancer research lakehouse covering 11,673 patients
  across 13 base tables with 60+ engineered features, cross-domain entity
  extraction, temporal linkage, and interactive Streamlit dashboards backed
  by MotherDuck cloud DuckDB. Includes reproducible ETE / AJCC 8th-edition
  staging analyses (ordinal recurrence-risk models; structural endpoint with
  propensity matching) under studies/proposal2_ete_staging, with manuscript
  alignment notes in MANUSCRIPT_REVISION_PACKET_20260326.md. NSQIP surgical
  outcomes linkage where applicable. The GitHub repository may be ahead of
  this Zenodo snapshot; create a new Zenodo version to archive later commits.
keywords:
  - thyroid cancer
  - papillary thyroid carcinoma
  - extrathyroidal extension
  - propensity score matching
  - clinical research
  - DuckDB
  - data lakehouse
  - AJCC 8th edition
